        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Sanibalati yumvise ko twubaka urwo ruzitiro rw’ amabuye, araraka arashangashirwa; aca aratunegura twebge Abayuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "avugira imbere ya bagenzi biwe n’imbere y’ingabo z’i Samariya, ati Barya bagoyigoyi b’Abayuda bakora ibiki? Mbega bagomba kwizitirira? Canke bazotanga ibimazi? Mbega bagomba kwubaka ngo buzuze ku musi umwe? None bozīkurura amabuye bayakūra mu bishingwe kandi yarahiye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi na Tobiya w’Umwamoni yar’ ahagararanye na we, aravuga, ati Ni mubareke bubake! N’imbgebge yosimbira kur’ urwo ruzitiro rw’ amabuye rwoca rusenyuka!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
