        {
          "text": "Maze ndasenga, nti Mana yacu, ni wumve ingene dukengerewe; ibitutsi vyabo abe ari bo bisubira ku mitwe; ubatange bajanwe mu mahanga ar’ inyagano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.4"
            ]
